# Routing-fragility study (research/): the raw per-question JSONL is published
# as a GitHub Release and fetched with research/fetch_data.py. The small
# telemetry files are committed; the 145 MB first-smoke-test telemetry is not.
!research/data/p1/**/*.telemetry.seg*.pt
!research/data/p3_selfchurn/**/*.telemetry.seg*.pt
!research/data/p3_smoke/**/*.telemetry.seg*.pt
